---
---

<section class="partners section band-dark">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="kicker reveal">
      <span class="kicker__label">Built With</span>
    </div>

    <div class="partners__grid reveal">
      <h2>The partners behind the network.</h2>
      <div class="partners__side">
        <p class="partners__lede">
          Rangeway is operated by a small team and built with partners across structure, energy,
          software, and driver experience.
          <a href="https://carbondc.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Carbon DC</a> anchors our
          off-grid sites,
          <a href="https://louteq.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LoüTeq</a> builds every
          structure,
          <a href="https://ekoenergetyka.com/america/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ekoenergetyka</a>
          delivers the chargers, and
          <a href="https://chargemate.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ChargeMate</a> stands by
          every driver.
        </p>
        <a class="btn-link partners__cta" href="/partners">
          See all partners
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
            <polyline points="13 6 19 12 13 18" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .partners__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
    gap: var(--space-6) clamp(48px, 7vw, 120px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .partners__grid h2 {
    max-width: 13ch;
  }

  .partners__lede {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
    color: var(--fg-on-dark-2);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 48ch;
  }

  .partners__lede a {
    color: var(--color-warm);
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244, 168, 85, 0.4);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
  }

  .partners__lede a:hover {
    color: var(--color-warm-lite);
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-warm-lite);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .partners__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
